  "reflectionText": "Paul wrote: Christ Jesus emptied himself, took the form of a servant, humbled himself, became obedient to the death of the cross. Therefore God exalted him and gave him the name above every name. What does it look like to follow the One who came down the whole way to the bottom, before he was given the name above every name?"
